      "id": "seg:code:declaration:0006:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nfunc overwriteChannels(_ channels: [UInt8], withPixel pixel: Pixel_8888, destination: vImage.PixelBuffer<Format>)\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nfunc overwriteChannels(_ channels: [UInt8], withPixel pixel: Pixel_8888, destination: vImage.PixelBuffer<Format>)\n```",
