      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Use this function to overwrite one or more channels of an interleaved buffer with a pixel value.",
      "ko": "이 함수는 인터리브 버퍼의 하나 이상의 채널을 픽셀 값으로 덮어쓸 때 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "28c59dcf81d20c49eeac9df57e239d05875d92dad3aabcbde56caa69a067d0f7",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "The following code overwrites channels `1` and `3` with the corresponding channels in `pixel` :",
      "ko": "다음 코드는 `pixel`의 해당 채널을 사용하여 `1` 및 `3` 채널을 덮어씁니다:",
      "sourceHash": "732d35d2bd62d893f6f4b774a6e8426fab348f614729e261e5ca8e37702aca31",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nlet pixelValues: [Pixel_8] = [ 1, 2, 3, 4,\n                               5, 6, 7, 8 ]\nlet buffer = vImage.PixelBuffer(pixelValues: pixelValues,\n                                size: vImage.Size(width: 1,\n                                                  height: 2),\n                                pixelFormat: vImage.Interleaved8x4.self)\n\nlet destination = vImage.PixelBuffer(size: vImage.Size(width: 1,\n                                                       height: 2),\n                                     pixelFormat: vImage.Interleaved8x4.self)\n\nlet pixel = Pixel_8888(101, 102, 103, 104)\n\nbuffer.overwriteChannels([3, 1],\n                         withPixel: pixel,\n                         destination: destination)\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nlet pixelValues: [Pixel_8] = [ 1, 2, 3, 4,\n                               5, 6, 7, 8 ]\nlet buffer = vImage.PixelBuffer(pixelValues: pixelValues,\n                                size: vImage.Size(width: 1,\n                                                  height: 2),\n                                pixelFormat: vImage.Interleaved8x4.self)\n\nlet destination = vImage.PixelBuffer(size: vImage.Size(width: 1,\n                                                       height: 2),\n                                     pixelFormat: vImage.Interleaved8x4.self)\n\nlet pixel = Pixel_8888(101, 102, 103, 104)\n\nbuffer.overwriteChannels([3, 1],\n                         withPixel: pixel,\n                         destination: destination)\n```",
      "sourceHash": "608434d9ad46975702123ef28dc82c3f3c76aeff6ecfb293a4e66b7a20e7dd4c",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "On return, `destination.array` contains the following values:",
      "ko": "반환되면 `destination.array`에는 다음 값이 포함됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "50f4493d12eecd40b573c326905b4d87028facaabe123df3aa445f3de74cbad5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "```swift\n[ 1, 102, 3, 104,\n  5, 102, 7, 104 ]\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\n[ 1, 102, 3, 104,\n  5, 102, 7, 104 ]\n```",
      "sourceHash": "73c7e811fe37e2b796501b333f9ec873714018ea8cc6142a8770ab88855171ef",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
